      "novel": {"flag": true, "justification": "The condition is satisfied by deterministic rotating-enrollment schedules whose covariate strata are balanced within geometrically growing blocks, including periodic registry intake and stratified platform traffic. It allows outcomes to be heterogeneous across units while excluding a single late block with a wholly different quantile composition."},
