    "niche": "A continuum target creates a design conflict that is absent for one quantile: the allocation minimizing average influence-score variance need not minimize the worst sequential-band width.",
    "fill": "The project identifies the two score-energy functionals governing that conflict, derives a one-dimensional Pareto representation, and couples it to a predictable learning rule and a time-and-quantile-uniform design-based band."
