  "technical_internal_limitation": "The band uses separate armwise CDF confidence sequences and Minkowski differencing. Its constant \\(b(r)\\) is therefore sharp for the marginal-inversion architecture, not asserted to be sharp among all joint QTE bands. The missing within-unit cross-arm quantile-score covariance is not identified by the randomization distribution; the open-ended question asks whether least-favorable pairing makes this conservatism minimax unavoidable.",
